  "name": "Barbarian: every Brutal Swing and Decapitate rank accepts a one-handed weapon (#5124, #5135)",
  "contract": [
    "Brutal Swing rank 2 (500996) and Decapitate rank 2 (806905) carry an EquippedItemInventoryTypeMask that",
    "their own EquippedItemSubClassMask contradicts: the subclass list admits one-handed axes, maces, swords,",
    "fists, daggers and spears, but the slot mask accepts only a two-handed weapon. A Barbarian wielding a",
    "one-handed weapon therefore gets SPELL_FAILED_EQUIPPED_ITEM_CLASS (29) from rank 2 onwards while rank 1",
    "(500913, 804414) succeeds. Every rank of both chains must accept the same one-handed weapon, and every",
    "rank must still refuse to cast with no weapon equipped. Decapitate is only usable on enemies below 35%",
    "health (TargetAuraState, checked before the weapon requirement), so both targets are lowered to 30% before",
    "any Decapitate cast. Each lower-rank control casts before learning its replacing higher rank; the native",
    "spellbook deactivates lower ranks when a higher rank is learned. Brutal Swing is an authored on-next-swing",
    "ability: each accepted queue executes on a real melee attack before the cast-count check. The explicit",
    "flat spawn faces the +X target."
  ],
